  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 207.01 Commencement of Hearing. A hearing shall be commenced by an order of the treasury giving notice to the parties as required by Tre 207.03.\n\nSource. #7589-A, eff 11-7-01; ss by #9575-A, eff 10-22-09",
